---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/sections/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Remote Support | Barons, Inc."
  description="Start a secure Zoho Assist remote-support session with the Barons team or contact us for help with QuickBooks, Zoho, payroll, payments, and business systems."
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <PageHero
      eyebrow="Client support"
      title="Get help from a real human."
      description="Use the secure remote-support panel below when a Barons team member has asked you to join a Zoho Assist session. For general questions, billing help, or a new support request, contact our team instead."
    />

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="remote-support-heading">
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-6 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20 md:p-10">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-green-300">Secure remote session</p>
          <h2 id="remote-support-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black text-white md:text-4xl">Join a Zoho Assist session</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-300">
            Only continue when a Barons team member has provided instructions or a session ID. You remain in control of your computer and can end the session at any time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white p-3">
          <iframe
            title="Zoho Assist remote support login"
            width="100%"
            height="150"
            src="https://assist.zoho.com/login/embed-remote-support.jsp"
            loading="lazy"
            referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
            class="block min-h-[150px] w-full border-0"
          ></iframe>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
          If the support panel does not load, open
          <a
            href="https://assist.zoho.com/login/embed-remote-support.jsp"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-bold text-green-300 underline decoration-green-300/40 underline-offset-4 hover:text-green-200"
          >Zoho Assist in a new window</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025]" aria-labelledby="support-options-heading">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-green-300">Before you connect</p>
          <h2 id="support-options-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black text-white md:text-4xl">Use the right support path</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-white">Remote session</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">Use the Zoho Assist panel when a Barons team member is actively helping you troubleshoot.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-white">General support</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">Need help but do not have an active session? Send the team a support request with the product, company, and issue.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="mt-5 inline-flex font-black text-green-300 hover:text-green-200">Contact support →</a>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-white">New project or strategy</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">For implementation, migration, cleanup, or system-design work, start with the Barons discovery process.</p>
            <a href="/start" class="mt-5 inline-flex font-black text-green-300 hover:text-green-200">Start here →</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="security-heading">
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-green-300">Your control matters</p>
          <h2 id="security-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black text-white md:text-4xl">Remote support should never feel mysterious.</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="grid gap-4 text-slate-300">
          <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">Confirm that you are speaking with a known Barons team member before joining.</li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">Never share passwords, verification codes, or banking credentials through chat.</li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">Close confidential files that are unrelated to the support request.</li>
          <li class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">End the session immediately if anything feels wrong.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
